<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure | HomeBackupCost" description="How HomeBackupCost may earn money from product links and installer quotes, and how that does and doesn't affect our recommendations.">
<h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
<p>HomeBackupCost plans to earn money through affiliate links. If you click a link to a retailer or brand and buy something, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. We may also be paid for installer-quote referrals.</p>
<p class="note"><strong>Current status (2026-10-25):</strong> we have no active affiliate accounts. Product buttons go to the brand's regular website and are marked in our code with <code>data-affiliate="placeholder"</code>. We'll update this page when that changes.</p>
<p>Commissions never change calculator results, which are ranked by technical fit and then by price. Commission rates vary by brand, and we won't promote a product because it pays more.</p>
<p>As an Amazon Associate, we would earn from qualifying purchases. That applies only if we join the program, which we haven't.</p>
</Base>
